    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zombieville USA 3D</strong> is a light-hearted action romp, combining classic arcade action with modern visuals and a dash of roguelite fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801520/extras/2fd5052c9381eef682c6d7be11531382.poster.avif?t=1741373611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801520/extras/2fd5052c9381eef682c6d7be11531382.webm?t=1741373611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801520/extras/2fd5052c9381eef682c6d7be11531382.mp4?t=1741373611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or with friends as you scavenge for weapons, unlock skills, and see how long you can survive before you become a midnight snack for the living dead!  Whether you played the original Zombieville USA over 15 years ago, or this is your first foray into the zombie-filled suburbs, we hope you\u2019ll enjoy your stay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801520/extras/69425becfd2022eebca939cb1c12a22e.poster.avif?t=1741373611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801520/extras/69425becfd2022eebca939cb1c12a22e.webm?t=1741373611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801520/extras/69425becfd2022eebca939cb1c12a22e.mp4?t=1741373611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> An arsenal of 39 weapons to unlock, from machine guns and shotguns, to chainsaws, rockets, energy weapons, flamethrowers, and katanas.  You name it, we probably got it. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 28 unlockable &quot;perks&quot; to level up, customizing your playstyle.  Specialize in melee weapons, explosives, whatever floats your boat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Randomly generated weapons with unique traits keep every run unpredictable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinitely scaling difficulty - go for your high score before the living dead overwhelm you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Spectacular stylized 3D visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Play solo or with online co-op for 3 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed to play great with a gamepad, but feels right at home with mouse and keyboard as well.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zombieville USA 3D</strong> is a light-hearted action romp, combining classic arcade action with modern visuals and a dash of roguelite fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801520/extras/2fd5052c9381eef682c6d7be11531382.poster.avif?t=1741373611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801520/extras/2fd5052c9381eef682c6d7be11531382.webm?t=1741373611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801520/extras/2fd5052c9381eef682c6d7be11531382.mp4?t=1741373611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or with friends as you scavenge for weapons, unlock skills, and see how long you can survive before you become a midnight snack for the living dead!  Whether you played the original Zombieville USA over 15 years ago, or this is your first foray into the zombie-filled suburbs, we hope you\u2019ll enjoy your stay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801520/extras/69425becfd2022eebca939cb1c12a22e.poster.avif?t=1741373611\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801520/extras/69425becfd2022eebca939cb1c12a22e.webm?t=1741373611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801520/extras/69425becfd2022eebca939cb1c12a22e.mp4?t=1741373611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> An arsenal of 39 weapons to unlock, from machine guns and shotguns, to chainsaws, rockets, energy weapons, flamethrowers, and katanas.  You name it, we probably got it. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 28 unlockable &quot;perks&quot; to level up, customizing your playstyle.  Specialize in melee weapons, explosives, whatever floats your boat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Randomly generated weapons with unique traits keep every run unpredictable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinitely scaling difficulty - go for your high score before the living dead overwhelm you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Spectacular stylized 3D visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Play solo or with online co-op for 3 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed to play great with a gamepad, but feels right at home with mouse and keyboard as well.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Zombieville USA 3D is a stylized arcade shooter combining retro gameplay with strikingly polished visuals. Fight through an endless undead horde in the bleak hellscape of suburbia! Choose your weapons, grab a friend, and see how long you can survive.",
